title: "Agent Knowledge Compiler and Control Plane (AKCP)"
abstract: "A compiler and control plane for organizational knowledge, turning Open Knowledge Format (OKF) bundles into versioned, deterministic Intermediate Representations and enforcing runtime Zero-Trust policies across Model Context Protocol (MCP) agents."
